// physicalPropsSanity folds the runtime-mint physics invariant into a probe score:
// every author of a NEW entity (the materializer's mentions, the scribe's captures)
// must judge the two physical axes the same way the furnisher does. Two violations,
// each a small multiplicative penalty so a sane run leaves the primary score intact:
//   - LORE must stay propertyless — a legend has neither thermal response nor fracture;
//   - an ITEM must ENGAGE both axes — a discrete carriable object is a solid body, so
