	// elapsed span (the metronome of hunger), and one at a meal is restored to full. The bodily
	// mirror of emotional maintenance — pure time-based upkeep, persisted when it changes. Hunger
	// over hours is what makes time-skips bite: a town fast-forwarded to morning wakes up hungry.
	for id, npc := range byID {
